 sb_1_i1:"Look! A poster: MOON CONCERT — BANDS WANTED!", sb_1_i2:"First prize: a lifetime of fish! 🐟🐟🐟", sb_1_i3:"But I'm SO hungry… If I'm late home, the others will eat ALL the dinner!", sb_1_e0_1:"Grave… very slow and serious. Daizu walked… so… s-l-o-w-l-y…", sb_1_e0_2:"The sun went down. Daizu got lost in the dark. No dinner tonight! 🌙", sb_1_e1_1:"Andante — a nice walking speed. Daizu strolled home, enjoying the view…", sb_1_e1_2:"…but the bowls were empty! Kuriito ate it all. Burp. 😿", sb_1_e2_1:"Presto — very fast! Daizu raced home like the wind! 💨", sb_1_e2_2:"First one home! A full bowl of fish, all for him. Now… let's find a band! ✨", sb_2_i1:"I need a singer for my band…", sb_2_i2:"Me! Me! I'll sing for you, right now!", sb_2_i3:"But it is midnight. The whole street is asleep… 💤", sb_2_e0_1:"Fortissimo — VERY LOUD! 🎤 Every car alarm went off! 🚨", sb_2_e0_2:"The neighbours threw slippers! 🥿🥿 Run, Kuriito, run!", sb_2_e1_1:"Mezzo forte — medium loud. The dogs woke up… WOOF! WOOF!", sb_2_e1_2:"Kuriito had to run away. 🐕💨", sb_2_e2_1:"Pianissimo — very, very soft… 🎶 The street kept sleeping.", sb_2_e2_2:"The moon clapped quietly. Daizu: “You're in the band!” 🌙👏", sb_3_i1:"I am Matcha the wizard. I can tune your guitar with a spell!", sb_3_i2:"Really?! Do it!", sb_3_i3:"But my spell only works if the notes flow smoothly — with no gaps.", sb_3_e0_1:"Staccato — short and detached! The spell came out in little bits… • • •", sb_3_e0_2:"The guitar turned into six tiny ukuleles! 🪕🪕🪕", sb_3_e1_1:"Legato — smooth and connected… ✨ the spell flows like water.", sb_3_e1_2:"The guitar is perfectly in tune! Matcha joins the band. 🎸✨", sb_3_e2_1:"Accent — BANG! 💥", sb_3_e2_2:"The spell exploded and Matcha's fur stood straight up! 😾⚡", sb_4_i1:"I will only join a band with a GRAND entrance.", sb_4_i2:"Here is my red carpet.", sb_4_i3:"The music must grow bigger with every step I take!", sb_4_e0_1:"Crescendo — louder and louder with every step… 🎺", sb_4_e0_2:"Magnificent! Azuki bows: “…Fine. I'll join. For art.” 👑", sb_4_e1_1:"Diminuendo — softer and softer… and softer…", sb_4_e1_2:"Nobody even noticed Azuki arrive. She is NOT amused. 😒", sb_4_e2_1:"Fermata — hold the note! The band held ONE note… for ten minutes. ⏰", sb_4_e2_2:"Azuki stood frozen with one paw in the air. 🧊", sb_5_i1:"Midnight… something floats in through the wall… 👻", sb_5_i2:"A g-g-g-ghost!", sb_5_i3:"To welcome a ghost, the music must slow down little by little…", sb_5_e0_1:"Accelerando — faster and faster and FASTER! 💨", sb_5_e0_2:"The music blew Sakura right back out through the wall! 👻💨", sb_5_e1_1:"Ritardando — slowing down little by little… Sakura floats in happily.", sb_5_e1_2:"“Nice band. But… you have no pianist.”", sb_5_e1_3:"Everyone slowly turns… and looks at YOU. 🎹", sb_5_e2_1:"A tempo — back to the normal speed. Sakura floated past without stopping.", sb_5_e2_2:"Ghosts like slow music! 👻", tm_grave:"very slow and serious 🐢", tm_andante:"at a walking speed 🚶", tm_presto:"very fast ⚡", tm_ff:"very loud 📢", tm_mf:"medium loud 🙂", tm_pp:"very soft 🤫", tm_stacc:"short and detached • • •", tm_legato:"smooth and connected ～", tm_accent:"play this note stronger >", tm_cresc:"getting louder little by little 📈", tm_dim:"getting softer little by little 📉", tm_ferm:"hold the note longer 𝄐", tm_accel:"getting faster little by little 🚀", tm_rit:"slowing down little by little 🐌", tm_atempo:"back to the normal speed", st_tap:"tap", st_rightWas:"The right word:",
 sb_6_i1:"ROOOAR! I am Leo, the King of Rhythm!", sb_6_i2:"W-w-we want to play at the Moon Concert…", sb_6_i3:"Then show me you can COUNT! My song is in 4/4.", st_6_q:"How many beats are in one bar of 4/4?", sb_6_e0_1:"Daizu counted: 1-2, 1-2, 1-2… the band played like a march.", sb_6_e0_2:"“That's a march for DUCKS!” Quack, quack! 🦆🦆", sb_6_e1_1:"Daizu counted: 1-2-3, 1-2-3… everyone started to waltz!", sb_6_e1_2:"The King spun round and round… and fell over. 💫", sb_6_e2_1:"1-2-3-4, 1-2-3-4! The band played perfectly together. 🎶", sb_6_e2_2:"“YES! You can count!” The King started to dance. 🕺", sb_7_i1:"Now — the Royal Parade! Everyone marches at the same steady speed. Not too fast, not too slow!", sb_7_i2:"The whole band lines up behind the King…", st_7_q:"Which word tells the band to march at a steady, medium speed?", sb_7_e0_1:"Moderato — a moderate, medium speed. Left, right, left, right…", sb_7_e0_2:"The parade was perfect! The whole town cheered. 👏", sb_7_e1_1:"Rubato — free, stretchy time! Some cats walked fast, some walked slow…", sb_7_e1_2:"Everyone bumped into each other. BONK! 💫", sb_7_e2_1:"Prestissimo — as fast as possible! The King raced off…", sb_7_e2_2:"…and rolled down the hill like a ball! 🦁⚽", sb_8_i1:"Tonight is the Royal Ball! We will dance the waltz!", sb_8_i2:"A waltz… how elegant. I shall dance with the King.", sb_8_i3:"Band, play a waltz! Hmm… how many beats does a waltz have?", st_8_q:"Which time signature is a waltz?", sb_8_e0_1:"2/4 — ONE-two, ONE-two… that's a march!", sb_8_e0_2:"The dancers stomped like soldiers and stepped on each other's toes. OUCH! 🦶", sb_8_e1_1:"3/4 — ONE-two-three, ONE-two-three… a real waltz!", sb_8_e1_2:"The King and Azuki waltzed under the chandelier. ✨", sb_8_e2_1:"4/4 — ONE-two-three-four… the dancers got confused…", sb_8_e2_2:"Azuki tripped and landed in the cake! 🎂", sb_9_i1:"Listen. Music needs to breathe, too.", sb_9_i2:"In my song there is a place where everyone is silent for exactly ONE beat.", st_9_q:"Which sign means: be silent for one beat?", sb_9_e0_1:"Quarter rest — silent for one beat… 🤫 …and on!", sb_9_e0_2:"The little silence made the music exciting! The King cried happy tears. 😭👑", sb_9_e1_1:"Whole note — a long note for 4 beats. Daizu held his note… and held it… and held it…", sb_9_e1_2:"He ran out of breath and turned blue! 🥶", sb_9_e2_1:"Tie — the notes join together, so the band never stopped at all…", sb_9_e2_2:"“No silence?! I SAID SILENCE!” 🦁💢", sb_10_i1:"The final test! At the end of my song you will see the letters D.C.", sb_10_i2:"The audience wants MORE! What do you do?", st_10_q:"The music says “go back to the beginning”. Which word is it?", sb_10_e0_1:"Fine — the end. The band stopped and went home.", sb_10_e0_2:"The audience threw popcorn: “MORE! MORE!” 🍿", sb_10_e1_1:"Da Capo — back to the beginning! The band played the whole song again!", sb_10_e1_2:"“You may play at the Moon Concert!” roared the King. 🌙🎉", sb_10_e1_3:"And under the moon, the cats' band was ready… To be continued! 🎹", sb_10_e2_1:"Coda — jump to the ending… The song was over in three seconds!", sb_10_e2_2:"“That's IT?!” said the King. Even the moon yawned. 🥱", tm_b2:"2 beats in a bar = 2/4 time, like a march: ONE-two", tm_b3:"3 beats in a bar = 3/4 time, like a waltz: ONE-two-three", tm_b4:"4/4 = 4 beats in every bar: 1-2-3-4", tm_moderato:"at a moderate, medium speed 🚶", tm_rubato:"free time — stretch and squeeze the speed", tm_prestissimo:"as fast as possible ⚡⚡", tm_t24:"2 beats in a bar — a march", tm_t34:"3 beats in a bar — a waltz 💃", tm_t44:"4 beats in a bar", tm_qrest:"be silent for one beat 𝄽", tm_whole:"a long note held for 4 beats", tm_tie:"joins two notes: play once, hold for both", tm_fine:"the end — stop here", tm_dc:"go back to the beginning ↩️", tm_coda:"jump to the ending part",
