 ptodoH:"What to practise now", spotNote:"While the timer runs, your teacher may hear a few short moments of your practice.", spotNow:"recording 15 s", ptl_tH:"Timer check (last 14 days)", ptl_tHow:"Every square is 10 seconds of the timer: green = the piano was heard, grey = silence.", ptl_tNone:"No timer practice yet.", ptl_tOn:"Spot checks: record 3 short moments (15 s) while the timer runs", ptl_tSpots:"Spot-check recordings", ptl_played:"{a} of {b} min with sound",
 rs_h:"Rhythm school", rs_week:"Week {n}", rs_go:"Start this week's rhythm", rs_again:"Practise again", rs_u_q:"Quarter note", rs_u_q_s:"1 dark-red apple = 1 beat = Tan", rs_u_e:"Eighth notes", rs_u_e_s:"bright-red half apples = ta-ta", rs_u_h:"Half note", rs_u_h_s:"2 apples stuck together = 2 beats = Taa", rs_u_s:"Sixteenth notes", rs_u_s_s:"green apple cut in 4 = 1 2 3 4", rs_u_t:"Triplets", rs_u_t_s:"golden apple cut in 3 = 1 2 3", rs_learn_q:"A quarter note is ONE dark-red apple: one beat. Clap it: Tan! The empty plate is a rest: say \"rest\" (no clap). Two apples side by side = two quarter notes: Tan Tan.", rs_learn_e:"Cut the bright-red apple in half: each half is an eighth note. Two halves together: ta-ta. One eighth note has a flag (a little tail). Two eighth notes hold hands: their tails join into a beam.", rs_learn_h:"Stick TWO apples together: a half note, two beats — Taa (clap once, hold for 2). Its head is empty (white). Two apples side by side (not stuck) are two quarter notes: Tan Tan.", rs_learn_s:"Cut the green apple in four: 1 2 3 4! A sixteenth note has TWO flags. Four of them join with TWO beams.", rs_learn_t:"Cut the golden apple into three pieces: 1 2 3. Three notes in one beat, with a 3 on top.", rs_st_copy:"Copy me 👏", rs_st_copy_s:"Listen and clap it back", rs_st_apple:"Line up the apples 🍎", rs_st_apple_s:"Build the rhythm you hear", rs_next:"A new rhythm opens every week.", rs_back:"Back", rs_copyHow:"Listen, then clap the same rhythm!", rs_listen:"Listen", rs_myTurn:"My turn", rs_ready:"Get ready…", rs_go2:"Clap!", rs_copyOk:"Perfect clapping! 👏", rs_copyNo:"Almost! Listen again and try once more.", rs_noMic:"No microphone — clap along, then tap if you did it right.", rs_selfOk:"I clapped it", rs_newOne:"New rhythm", rs_appleHow:"Listen. Then line up the apples to make the same rhythm (4 beats).", rs_check:"Check", rs_appleOk:"Yes! That's the rhythm 🍎", rs_appleNo:"Not quite — here is the answer:", rs_trace:"Trace the dotted note with your finger", rs_alone:"Now write it by yourself!", rs_erase:"Erase", rs_writeOk:"Beautiful! ✨", rs_wEmpty:"Draw with your finger in the box!", rs_wMissing:"Something is missing — look at the model again.", rs_wMessy:"Try to stay on the lines — a bit slower!", rs_tip_q:"1. Draw the head and colour it in. 2. Draw the stem straight up on the right.", rs_tip_h:"1. Draw the head — keep it empty! 2. The stem goes up on the right.", rs_tip_e:"Head, stem… and a flag (a little tail) at the top!", rs_tip_ee:"Two eighth notes hold hands: draw both, then join the tops with a thick beam.", rs_tip_s:"A sixteenth note has TWO flags.", rs_tip_ssss:"Two notes joined with TWO beams.", rs_tip_tri:"Three notes, one beam, and a 3 on top.", rs_w_q:"quarter note", rs_w_h:"half note", rs_w_e:"eighth note", rs_w_ee:"two eighth notes", rs_w_s:"sixteenth note", rs_w_ssss:"sixteenths", rs_w_tri:"triplet", rs_star:"⭐ Star for Rhythm school!",
